<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Wireframe4</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #6b6666;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 40px;
      background-color: #87c2d6;
    }

    header nav a {
      margin: 0 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #dedede;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    header .logo img {
      height: 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .greece{
      background-color: #c7e4f2;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .greece h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .greece .btn {
      background-color: #222;
      color: rgb(78, 126, 147);
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }


    .greece p {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .greece img {
      width: 60%;
      max-width: 700px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .features {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      background-color:  #87c2d6;;
    }

    .features-text {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 45%;
    }

    .features-text h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
   .features-list {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      max-width: 45%;
    }
    .features-text p {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .feature-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .feature-item img {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .features {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .features-text, .features-list {
        max-width: 100%;
      }
      .greece img {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">Destinations</a>
      <a href="#">Activities</a>
      <a href="#">itineraries</a>
      <a href="#">Experience</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="logo">
      <img src="img/il_570xN.1978336645_ec6l.jpg.avif">
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="greece">
    <h1> The Beautiful Country Of Greece</h1>
    
    <p>Greece is a mountainous country in Southern Europe on the Balkan peninsula, known for its rugged mainland and approximately 2,000 islands scattered across the Aegean, Ionian, and Mediterranean seas. It is a parliamentary republic with a population of over 10 million and a market economy. Key features include its extensive coastline, numerous islands, a standard Mediterranean climate, and rich history and culture.  </p>
    <img src="img/licensed-image.jpeg" alt="Greece">
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="features-text">
      <h2>Popular places to Visit</h2>
      <p>Popular places in Greece include Athens (for ancient history and the Acropolis), Santorini and Mykonos (for romantic or scenic island getaways), Crete (for a mix of history, beaches, and diverse landscapes), and Meteora (for its unique monasteries atop rock formations). Other popular spots are Rhodes (for medieval history), Corfu (known for its green, Ionian scenery), and Thessaloniki (a hub for food and culture).</p>
      <a href="#">Learn More</a>
    </div>
    <div class="features-list">
      <div class="feature-item">
        <img src="img/premium_photo-1661962345279-4d1d7a98409a.jpeg" alt="Actvites">
        <p>Greek ruins are often characterized by their emphasis on symmetry, simplicity, and harmony, with many sites featuring large, well-preserved structures like the Acropolis of Athens, which includes the Parthenon, a temple dedicated to the goddess Athena. These ruins are typically ancient temples, public buildings, or entire citadels built from stone and marble.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-item">
        <img src="img/photo-1631992352227-11a9843a229f.jpeg" alt="Actvites">
        <p>a boat in Greece offers a flexible way to explore the islands and coastlines, with options ranging from bareboat charters for experienced sailors to skippered and crewed luxury yachts for all experience levels. You can choose from various boat types like sailing yachts, catamarans, or motorboats and experience different sailing regions</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-item">
         <img src="img/images.jpeg">
        <p>Beaches in Greece are diverse, featuring everything from long sandy stretches and pebble beaches to unique volcanic shores in places like Santorini, which has red and black sand. Visitors can find options ranging from organized beaches with amenities to remote, secluded coves accessible only by boat, with popular examples including Navagio (Shipwreck Beach) in Zakynthos and the pink sands of Elafonissi in Crete..</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
